      "width": 280,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#A6843D",
      "text": "## Year rail\nShow work up to a year. Later pedestals stay in the room, ghosted."
    },
    {
      "id": "fb200ec8b23a685b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#A6843D",
      "text": "## Hall\nThe corridor is the experience. A hall whose exhibits are all later is sealed."
    },
    {
      "id": "bba4810281c0a887",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#E4E7EA",
      "text": "## Plate\nA zinc reading tool inside the hall. Ink on metal. One exhibit at a time."
    },
    {
      "id": "a309b3cf5b6625c1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#E4E7EA",
      "text": "## Ask\nQuestions are answered only from sourced nodes on this floor."
    },
    {
